= Introduction <sec:intro>

Documentation structures decay rapidly without strict architectural guardrails.
By moving away from heavy, macro-dense typesetting suites, engineers can preserve clean history records.
This module demonstrates localized layout safety within decoupled plain text directories.

== Core Paradigm
Every structural unit should begin on a fresh semantic line break.
This practice ensures individual sentences match line modifications exactly during Git code reviews.
We isolate logic layers to preserve build paths, a mechanism thoroughly validated by @fowler2018.
